1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,670
lokkathaon ke anusar Mahabharat
mein ek aisa Pandav bhi tha,

2
00:00:03,670 --> 00:00:06,610
jise pahle se pata tha ki
yuddh mein kya hone wala hai,

3
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:09,320
kaun marega aur kiski jeet hogi.

4
00:00:09,453 --> 00:00:11,543
phir bhi usne kisi ko kuch nahi bataya!

5
00:00:11,643 --> 00:00:12,918
uska naam tha Sahadev.

6
00:00:12,968 --> 00:00:17,948
we Pandavon mein sabse chhote the aur apni
buddhimatta tatha jyotish gyaan ke liye

7
00:00:17,948 --> 00:00:18,878
prasiddh the.

8
00:00:19,003 --> 00:00:20,783
lokaprachlit katha ke anusar,

9
00:00:20,783 --> 00:00:24,241
Sahadev ko bhavishya dekhne
ki adbhut shakti prapt thi.

10
00:00:24,291 --> 00:00:29,271
unhe pata tha ki Kurukshetra ka yuddh
hone wala hai aur usmein kitne vinashkari

11
00:00:29,271 --> 00:00:30,681
parinam samne aayenge.

12
00:00:30,816 --> 00:00:33,606
lekin unke gyaan ke saath
ek shraap bhi juda tha.

13
00:00:33,706 --> 00:00:38,406
kaha jata hai ki agar unhone bhavishya ki
ghatnaon ke bare mein kisi ko swayam bata

14
00:00:38,406 --> 00:00:40,636
diya, toh unka sir phat jayega.

15
00:00:40,728 --> 00:00:44,773
isi vajah se, is katha ke anusar,
we bhavishya jante hue bhi chup rahe.

16
00:00:44,773 --> 00:00:48,663
yahan tak ki unhe yuddh ke bhayanak
parinamon ka bhi gyaan tha,

17
00:00:49,113 --> 00:00:52,785
lekin katha ke anusar we unhe
rokne ke liye kuch nahi kah paye.

18
00:00:52,835 --> 00:00:56,125
kalpna kijiye,
aapke pas bhavishya janne ki shakti ho,

19
00:00:56,215 --> 00:00:58,765
lekin aap kisi ko
chetavni bhi na de sakein!

20
00:00:58,823 --> 00:01:02,373
kya Sahadev ki chuppi majboori
thi ya unki sabse badi galti?

21
00:01:02,465 --> 00:01:03,837
comment mein hamein bataiye.

